	quest.19111D80724DC917.quest_desc: [
		""
		"{image:minecraft:textures/rcttutorial1.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"Find this Trader! He will spawn somewhere if you have your &eTrainer Card&r!"
		""
		"&n&eGO TO NEXT PAGE>>>"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:minecraft:textures/rcttutorial2.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"You will be able to choose your progression! &cRadical &4Red &ror &bDiamond &rand &dPearl&r!"
		" "
		"&1Unbound &rwill be unlocked when you have completed one of the two!"
		""
		"&zFreeroam &ris also available for players who dont want to play with a level cap!"
		""
		"&e&nGO TO NEXT PAGE>>>"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:minecraft:textures/rcttutorial3.png width:165 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"Click the &aCheckmark&r on the &etop right&r!"
		""
		"&e&nGO TO NEXT PAGE>>>"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:minecraft:textures/rcttutorial4.png width:165 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"&nClick the corrupted name!&r The next trainer you will fight next in the progression will always have corrupted name!"
		""
		"&e&nGO TO NEXT PAGE>>>"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:minecraft:textures/rcttutorial5.png width:165 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"To find out which &eitem &rto use in the &btrainer spawner&r, click the &b\">\" &rto go to the next page of the gui!"
		""
		"&e&nGO TO NEXT PAGE>>>"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:minecraft:textures/rcttutorial6.png width:165 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"The &asignature item &rtells you what item to put inside the &btrainer spawner&r!"
		""
